  "question": {
    "text": "A multiple-choice question has <math><mn>5</mn></math> options of which only one is correct. If a student does home work, then he is sure to identify the correct answer, otherwise the answer is chosen at random. Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> be the event that the student does his home work and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> be the event that the student answers correctly. If <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>, then&nbsp;<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∩</mo><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#x22C5;</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br />"
